    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Stand Legends</strong>\u00a0throws you into a post-apocalyptic world overrun by zombies, ghouls, and mutated beasts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast open world filled with danger and mystery, where survival depends on your skills and strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Character Progression Across Modes:</strong>\u00a0Your character\u2019s skills, gear, and upgrades earned in Single Player carry over seamlessly when you join Online Co-op games, allowing you to team up with friends without losing any progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-World Exploration:</strong>\u00a0Roam freely across diverse environments, from ruined cities to eerie forests, uncovering secrets and resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action-Packed Combat:</strong>\u00a0Engage in fast-paced battles using a variety of weapons and abilities to slay zombies, zombie-dogs, zombie-bears, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-Op Multiplayer:</strong>\u00a0Join forces with players online to survive the undead hordes together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse undead enemies:</strong> Including zombies, ghouls, and mutated creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Zombie Bosses:</strong>\u00a0Face terrifying bosses with unique mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep character customization and progression system: </strong>Customize your character with skills, gear, and upgrades to adapt to the evolving threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environment:</strong> Dynamic day-night cycle and weather effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for your\u00a0<strong>last stand </strong>\u2014 will you become a <strong>Legend</strong> or just another victim of the Undead?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Stand Legends</strong>\u00a0throws you into a post-apocalyptic world overrun by zombies, ghouls, and mutated beasts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast open world filled with danger and mystery, where survival depends on your skills and strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Character Progression Across Modes:</strong>\u00a0Your character\u2019s skills, gear, and upgrades earned in Single Player carry over seamlessly when you join Online Co-op games, allowing you to team up with friends without losing any progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-World Exploration:</strong>\u00a0Roam freely across diverse environments, from ruined cities to eerie forests, uncovering secrets and resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action-Packed Combat:</strong>\u00a0Engage in fast-paced battles using a variety of weapons and abilities to slay zombies, zombie-dogs, zombie-bears, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-Op Multiplayer:</strong>\u00a0Join forces with players online to survive the undead hordes together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse undead enemies:</strong> Including zombies, ghouls, and mutated creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Zombie Bosses:</strong>\u00a0Face terrifying bosses with unique mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep character customization and progression system: </strong>Customize your character with skills, gear, and upgrades to adapt to the evolving threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environment:</strong> Dynamic day-night cycle and weather effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for your\u00a0<strong>last stand </strong>\u2014 will you become a <strong>Legend</strong> or just another victim of the Undead?</p>",
