        "notes": "Last Stand Legends features intense violence and gore consistent with a post-apocalyptic zombie survival game. \r\nPlayers will encounter graphic depictions of combat, including blood, dismemberment, and gruesome undead enemies such as zombies, mutated creatures, and bosses. \r\nThe game contains scenes of horror and unsettling imagery typical of the zombie genre.\r\n\r\nThere are no depictions of sexual acts, sexual assault, or non-consensual content. \r\nSubstance abuse, including drug or alcohol use, is not a focal theme and is only referenced indirectly through fictional experimental substances used by certain characters (e.g., the \"Crazy Scientist\" boss\u2019s green goo). \r\n\r\nThere are no portrayals of self-harm.\r\n\r\nMature language may be present in dialogue reflecting the harsh and desperate world setting. \r\nOverall, the game is intended for mature audiences due to its violent and horror themes."
    },
